dwl (dwl-forge) is the Wayland window manager.
	super+d - Open app launcher (walker)
	super+return - Open terminal
	super+shift+return - Toggle scratchpad terminal
	super+shift+p - Toggle scratchpad (Bitwarden)
	super+shift+w - Toggle scratchpad (nmtui, floating)
	super+b - Toggle status bar
	ctrl_r - Show keybind cheatsheet (wlr-which-key)
	super+c - Open clipboard history (cliphist)
	super+backspace - Open system action menu (sysact)
	super+F3 - Select display layout (displayselect)
	super+alt+u - Open URL/file handler menu (dmenuhandler)
	super+alt+m - Mount a CIFS share (dmenumountcifs)
	super+alt+w - Launch a web app (weblaunch)
	super+alt+p - Pick a screenshot region/window (maimpick-wl)
	super+alt+r - Toggle screen/audio recording (dmenurecord)
	super+F4 - Open volume mixer (pulsemixer)
	super+F7 - Open unicode/emoji picker
	super+i - Install a package (pkg-install)
	super+shift+r - Remove a package (pkg-remove)
	super+shift+c - Launch WhatsApp Web
	super+F1 - Open desktop app launcher (j4-dmenu-desktop)
	super+plus - Raise volume 5%
	super+shift+plus - Raise volume 15%
	super+w - Open browser
	super+z - Open music player
	super+e - Open email client
	super+r - Open file manager (lfub)
	super+shift+h - Open htop
	super+shift+y - Search YouTube (ytfzf)
	super+n - Open wiki index (nvim)
	Fn+F7 (emoji key) - Open unicode/emoji picker
	Fn+F8 (screen capture key) - Take a region screenshot
	Fn+F6 (dictation key) - Toggle screen/audio recording
	Fn+F10 (search key) - Open app launcher
	super+F8 / super+s - Take a screenshot
	audio mute key - Toggle output mute
	mic mute key - Toggle input mute
	volume up/down keys - Adjust output volume 3%
	media prev/next/play/pause/stop keys - Control player (playerctl)
	brightness up/down keys - Adjust screen brightness 15%
	super+j/k - Focus next/prev window in stack
	super+shift+i/d - Increase/decrease number of master windows
	super+h/l - Shrink/grow master area
	super+space - Zoom selected window to/from master area
	super+tab - Switch to previously selected tags
	super+g - Toggle gaps
	super+q - Close focused window
	super+shift+f - Toggle floating on focused window
	super+t - Tiled layout
	super+f - Floating layout
	super+m - Monocle layout
	super+o - Window switcher menu
	super+alt+o - Layout switcher menu
	super+[1-9] - View tag
	super+ctrl+[1-9] - Toggle view tag
	super+shift+[1-9] - Send window to tag
	super+ctrl+shift+[1-9] - Toggle tag on window
	super+0 - View all tags
	super+v - View only tags of focused window
	super+shift+= - Send window to all tags
	super+, / super+. - Focus prev/next monitor
	super+< / super+> - Send window to prev/next monitor
	super+shift+< / super+shift+> - Send all tagged windows to prev/next monitor
	super+shift+, / super+shift+. - Send window to prev/next monitor
	super+shift+q - Quit dwl
	left-click layout symbol - Tiled layout
	right-click layout symbol - Monocle layout
	super+left-drag window - Move window
	super+middle-click window - Toggle floating
	super+right-drag window - Resize window
	left-click tag - View tag
	right-click tag - Toggle view tag
	super+left-click tag - Send window to tag
	super+right-click tag - Toggle tag on window
	left-click tray icon - Activate tray item
	right-click tray icon - Open tray item menu
	left/middle/right-click status module - Run module's click command (statuscmd)
